                    <li><a class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="https://wa.me/555499164669?text=Gostaria%20de%20saber%20sobre%20Garantia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Garantia</a></li>
